# amtool, Alertmanager's own config checker and route tester (root ADR-0591), from the Alertmanager release
# archive. fetch_pinned.py is the only downloader; the version and SHA-256 live here (root ADR-0197).
# The version is the Alertmanager image's in compose.observability.yml, so the routes are tested by the
# engine that routes them; the guard alertmanager-routes-pass-their-tests refuses the two apart.
# Bump: set the version, then put each archive's line from the release's sha256sums.txt below.
